{"id":"maravilloso","lemma":"maravilloso","pos":"adj","rank":668,"glosses":["wonderful, marvelous"],"ipa":"/maɾabiˈʝoso/","forms":{"feminine":"maravillosa","masculinePlural":"maravillosos","femininePlural":"maravillosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-maravilloso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿No es eso maravilloso?","en":"Isn't that marvelous?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635558"},{"text":"La vida es maravillosa.","en":"Life is wonderful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799007"},{"text":"Eran maravillosos.","en":"They were amazing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448991"},{"text":"Tuvimos unas vacaciones maravillosas.","en":"We had a wonderful holiday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524500"},{"text":"Fue un día maravilloso.","en":"It was a wonderful day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460925"}]}